At most K
     ↓
count <= K → valid
count > K  → invalid → shrink



Expand right
     ↓
Window becomes invalid
     ↓
Shrink from left
     ↓
Keep shrinking only until valid
     ↓
Continue expanding
     ↓
Track maximum



right → always moves forward

left → moves forward ONLY when window is invalid


right → always moves forward

distinct > k → window invalid → left++

distinct <= k → window valid → keep going